        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a complete experience upon purchase, without any interference from in-game purchases, allowing players to enjoy every level without any hassle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Background</strong>: On a magical continent, werewolves and mages have fought for centuries. As mages suffer defeat and werewolves near total victory, a mage summons a dragon that destroys the werewolf tribe. The surviving werewolves set out to rebuild their home at the ancestral temple ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main City System</strong>: Players can freely construct and upgrade buildings in the main city, manage resources, and plan the development of the tribe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030740/extras/9e0b4150ab3b3806623ad062d2be9ce6.avif?t=1760579291\" width=1278 height=718 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Werewolf Breeding</strong>: Players can raise werewolf offspring (cubs), each with a chance to inherit talents and a career.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030740/extras/f5d0fb124c24f9b6d6b49d584223f68d.avif?t=1760579291\" width=1276 height=718 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career System</strong>: The game features a four-tier career system, with 10 careers available at the fourth tier. All cubs can advance to the fourth-tier careers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030740/extras/f5f64cab1f21bd4021524248e52f5f8a.avif?t=1760579291\" width=1280 height=718 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training System</strong>: Werewolves can be trained in the training ground to improve their attributes, enhancing combat abilities and survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030740/extras/904e359152c24f440bbc3ee22ea827ea.avif?t=1760579291\" width=1276 height=718 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expedition System</strong>: Players can send werewolves on expeditions at the Stone Circle, earning experience, items, and resource rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030740/extras/322f336408367efe04e6f6462b050cef.avif?t=1760579291\" width=1276 height=718 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource &amp; Growth Management</strong>: Upgrading buildings, training werewolves, and conducting expeditions require careful resource management, forming a complete growth loop.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a complete experience upon purchase, without any interference from in-game purchases, allowing players to enjoy every level without any hassle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Background</strong>: On a magical continent, werewolves and mages have fought for centuries. As mages suffer defeat and werewolves near total victory, a mage summons a dragon that destroys the werewolf tribe. The surviving werewolves set out to rebuild their home at the ancestral temple ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main City System</strong>: Players can freely construct and upgrade buildings in the main city, manage resources, and plan the development of the tribe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030740/extras/9e0b4150ab3b3806623ad062d2be9ce6.avif?t=1760579291\" width=1278 height=718 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Werewolf Breeding</strong>: Players can raise werewolf offspring (cubs), each with a chance to inherit talents and a career.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030740/extras/f5d0fb124c24f9b6d6b49d584223f68d.avif?t=1760579291\" width=1276 height=718 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career System</strong>: The game features a four-tier career system, with 10 careers available at the fourth tier. All cubs can advance to the fourth-tier careers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030740/extras/f5f64cab1f21bd4021524248e52f5f8a.avif?t=1760579291\" width=1280 height=718 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training System</strong>: Werewolves can be trained in the training ground to improve their attributes, enhancing combat abilities and survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030740/extras/904e359152c24f440bbc3ee22ea827ea.avif?t=1760579291\" width=1276 height=718 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expedition System</strong>: Players can send werewolves on expeditions at the Stone Circle, earning experience, items, and resource rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030740/extras/322f336408367efe04e6f6462b050cef.avif?t=1760579291\" width=1276 height=718 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource &amp; Growth Management</strong>: Upgrading buildings, training werewolves, and conducting expeditions require careful resource management, forming a complete growth loop.</p></li></ul>",
